sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Maker
  participant R as Different approver
  participant A as API / application
  participant P as Domain planner
  participant D as Database / UoW
  participant W as Outbox worker
  U->>A: Preview command + versions
  A->>D: Consistent read / scope + current policies
  A->>P: Deterministic plan
  A-->>U: Read-only plan + signed dependencies
  U->>A: Submit valid preview (no GL)
  A->>D: Persist immutable ApprovalRequest + maker + audit
  R->>A: Read authorized submitted request
  A-->>R: Stored plan + dependency versions + approval expiry
  R->>A: Explicit approval + request digest + idempotency key
  A->>A: Authenticate / current action and scope authorization
  alt permission now revoked
    A-->>R: 403; never disclose old receipt
  else currently authorized
  A->>D: Begin / lock scope and touched objects
  A->>D: Recheck current authorization under matching policy locks
  A->>D: Check key fingerprint (principal / scope / payload)
  alt key fingerprint differs
    A-->>R: 409; no old receipt or new posting
  else same accepted fingerprint
    A-->>R: Original receipt; no new write
  else new command
    A->>D: Lock request / submitted / expiry / versions / maker != approver
    A->>P: Same planner with current locked state
    A->>D: Verify original digest; reject stale request, never auto-refresh
    A->>D: Business + GL + facts + approved request + receipt + audit + outbox
    D-->>A: Commit all or rollback all
    A-->>R: Accepted receipt or explicit error
    W->>D: Claim committed outbox / idempotent inbox
    W->>A: Refresh derived report; never repair GL silently
  end
  end
  Note over U,D: Reject / withdraw / expire submitted requests without GL; short preview token expiry is not approval expiry.
  Note over A,D: Separate manual-journal queued route preserves pending/failed/transferred/withdrawn; no subledger async extension.
